Formatter: never parenthesize a starred expression (`x = (*"""\n""")` is a syntax error).
Regression test included; fuzz repro: repro/fix-formatter-starred-parentheses.py (ruff_formatter_validity).

diff --git a/crates/ruff_python_formatter/resources/test/fixtures/ruff/expression/starred.py b/crates/ruff_python_formatter/resources/test/fixtures/ruff/expression/starred.py
